@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Custom runtime guidance
+
+The custom runtime supplies `createOrderTriageAgent` with an asynchronous canonical-instruction loader. The factory requests `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md` and awaits its content before returning the runtime agent.
+
+Preserve the returned agent ID `order-triage`, action `classify-for-human-review`, and `canApproveRefunds: false` constraint. The factory does not establish refund-approval authority or any model-visible tools.
